### sample items (legacy)
GET https://localhost:8091/api/order/items

### ping / liveness
GET https://localhost:8091/api/order/ping

### bulk feed (large order list for load/aggregation; random item/status/qty)
GET https://localhost:8091/api/order/bulk?size=500&itemRange=250

### bulk feed — fault injection (returns HTTP 500)
GET https://localhost:8091/api/order/bulk?fail=true

### list all orders
GET https://localhost:8091/api/order

### get one order
GET https://localhost:8091/api/order/ORD-900

### create order
POST https://localhost:8091/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Charlie",
  "item": "Monitor",
  "quantity": 1,
  "total": 199.99
}

### update order
PUT https://localhost:8091/api/order/ORD-901
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHIPPED",
  "quantity": 3
}

### delete order
DELETE https://localhost:8091/api/order/ORD-901

### secondary instance
GET https://localhost:8092/api/order/items
